<title>USA: Micrel sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Micrel sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micrel Inc said Friday it had declared a two-for-one stock split, to be distributed by August 19, record August 4.</p>
<p>The split will increase the number of outstanding shares to about 19 million, it said.</p>
</text>
